Install of build 4453 on the physical iPad, as run on 16 October 2026 (local time, UTC+8).
The app had been staged and signed in place; devicectl output is verbatim, minus the JSON
command record, which is install.json.

$ xcrun devicectl device install app --device 00008112-000924EE14D9A01E \
      "$PWD/work/performance/build4453/Payload/iSH ARM64.app" \
      --json-output work/performance/build4453/install.json
