The install replaced the bundle in place: the same bundle id keeps the app data, and the
app's Linux system is not touched because the bundled root.tar.gz is the installed one
(root.version 202610031701, no bundled root.version in either build). Steam, the game and
the save slots are inside that system, not in the bundle.
